{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Vienna, September 21\n\nMy dear Marie,\n\nI have arrived here safely. The journey from Prague was a hurried affair; in thirty-six hours we covered forty miles. Sharing the coach with us was a couple returning from Carlsbad, and the personal physician of Archduke Charles.\n\nThe household of Archduke Charles is hosting me. Today I was at the Italian opera house. They performed an opera by Mercadante, and the voices were remarkable: Rubini, Donzelli, Lablache, and Eckerlin. The evening was short, but the music was good.\n\nOn my return, I found Lilli and Klein already at the inn. We sat together and chatted. It was a quiet end to the day. I am well and think of you.\n\nYour\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221186,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":174,"prompt_tokens":261,"total_tokens":435,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-Fn5GcptBWUqKo3deBlOVmAwYMaYad2mr","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":261,"prompt_ms":481.037,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.8430536398467432,"prompt_per_second":542.5778058652453,"predicted_n":174,"predicted_ms":4092.22,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.654450867052024,"predicted_per_second":42.27534199041108}}